How does multi-profile support work with:
staging
Environment variable
Same behavior, useful for plugin integration where CLI args cannot be modified:
AWS_MCP_PROXY_PROFILES="prod-readonly dev staging"
Note
AWS_MCP_PROXY_PROFILES takes precedence over --profile and AWS_PROFILE when
set.
Example MCP config
{
"mcpServers": {
"aws-mcp": {
"command": "uvx",
"args": ["mcp-proxy-for-aws==1.6.3", "https://aws-mcp.us-east-1.api.aws/mcp"],
"env": {
"AWS_MCP_PROXY_PROFILES": "prod-readonly dev staging"
}
}
